\item OpenAI, \emph{Universal optimality of the triangular lattice}, 2026-09-23; citation key \texttt{OAI:Universal-optimality-of-the-triangular-lattice-September-23-2026}. \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Universal-optimality-of-the-triangular-lattice-September-23-2026/paper.pdf}{PDF (GitHub)}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/raw/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Universal-optimality-of-the-triangular-lattice-September-23-2026/paper.pdf}{PDF (direct)}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Universal-optimality-of-the-triangular-lattice-September-23-2026/README.md}{Manuscript page and citation}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/main/preprints/Universal-optimality-of-the-triangular-lattice-September-23-2026/paper.pdf}{Latest version}; Statement source: \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Universal-optimality-of-the-triangular-lattice-September-23-2026/build/sections/08-renormalized-jellium.tex\#L133}{cor:riesz-jellium}.
\item Family 090: \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/lean/docs/090.md}{Lean scope}.
